<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπη</span></b> , ἡ, unknown
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bird of prey,</i> prob.
				<i>shearwater,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθήνη] ἅρπῃ ἐϊκυῖα τανυπτέρυγι
					λιγυφώνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.350
				</span></i>
			; a <i>sea-bird</i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				609a24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i> (describing the <i>Lämmergeier</i>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sickle,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπανον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				573
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				424
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλαμητόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.987
				</span></i>
			: hence, the <i>scimitar</i> of Perseus, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecyd.
				11J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				192
			</span></i> (lyr., pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>elephant-goad,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				13.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. of a
			hippopotamus' <i>tooth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				567
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bill-hook,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				14.15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> kind of
				<i>fish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Marc.Sid.
				22
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lat. <i>sarpio, sarpo,</i> etc.)</div>
